Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.25,0:01:37.88,sign_8302_60_Episode_1__I_Lov,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(920,1034)\an1\pos(298,300)\fscx93}Episode 5{\fscx100}    {\fsp3.1}Just the Way You Are
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.51,0:01:38.91,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,My minions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.36,0:01:43.15,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Have you steeled yourselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.17,0:01:58.93,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Then I shall now present the \NPrincess Series monthly reports!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.23,0:02:02.54,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,You have been evaluated on combat outcomes,\N negative energy accumulation,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.54,0:02:05.18,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,drive, enthusiasm, et cetera.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.18,0:02:08.69,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,First on the overall leaderboard is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.24,0:02:12.69,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Bear's team once again in a landslide!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.69,0:02:17.18,sign_3182_9_Reaper_Princess,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(225,318,236,303)\t(1,4490,\fs15)}Reaper Princess
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.69,0:02:17.18,sign_3182_9_Reaper_Princess,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(470,320,455,305)\t(1,4490,\fs15)}Beast Princess
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.29,0:02:17.18,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Their streak of breakaway leads over \Nthe second-place finisher continues!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.79,0:02:21.93,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Reaper Princess is also very \Naggressive in suggesting plans,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.93,0:02:24.45,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,and she has a perfect \Ncombat attendance record.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.70,0:02:27.05,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Truly, she is a role model for evil!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.83,0:02:32.03,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Beating Red half to death the other \Nday also earned her big points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.62,0:02:34.59,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,You could all learn a thing or two from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.84,0:02:38.57,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Reaper-san is very impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.57,0:02:39.84,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Grr...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.10,0:02:42.41,main,Combatant A,0,0,0,,Could we have a word about \Nyour first-place ranking?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.64,0:02:45.09,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm very pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.09,0:02:50.68,main,Combatant A,0,0,0,,And to celebrate your achievement, \Nyou receive a Super Bosslar-kun Doll!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:55.14,main,Beast,0,0,0,,This ain't gonna stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.14,0:02:57.69,main,Beast,0,0,0,,You think you can outshine me \Nevery single damned time...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.92,0:03:00.19,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Let's settle this, Reaper Princess! You and me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.19,0:03:01.40,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Please calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.40,0:03:03.07,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You can have this, if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.07,0:03:04.73,main,Beast,0,0,0,,I don't want the damned thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.47,0:03:04.85,sign_4399_28_Missing,sfx,0,0,0,,{\pos(130,20)\fad(1,750)}thonk
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.29,0:03:17.80,sign_4635_29_Cafeteria,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz9.77\fax-0.12\move(405,120,405,83)}Cafeteria
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.54,0:03:29.18,main,Gekko Cook,0,0,0,,Here you are! One pasta set!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.53,0:03:31.58,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Stupid Reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.58,0:03:33.19,main,Beast,0,0,0,,I'll show her soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.19,0:03:35.94,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Next time, I'm gonna be number one!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.91,0:03:38.77,main,Steel,0,0,0,,I suppose we'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.77,0:03:40.69,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Shut your hole, last-placer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.69,0:03:42.70,main,Beast,0,0,0,,And what's that crap you're eatin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.70,0:03:43.95,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Pickled sea cucumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.95,0:03:45.45,main,Beast,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.55,0:03:48.07,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Beast Princess...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.07,0:03:50.57,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,She appears to have some \Nkind of grudge against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.57,0:03:53.58,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,She hates losing, and suffers \Nfrom violent mood swings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.42,0:03:55.92,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Steel Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.92,0:03:58.09,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,She seems to exist in her own little world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.09,0:04:01.59,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,She's uncompetitive, \Nand she's hard to get a handle on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.59,0:04:03.19,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Would you like a bite?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.19,0:04:03.97,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Hell no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.28,0:04:06.19,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,They're a fun little duo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.55,0:04:08.13,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Would you hear me out, Beast-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.13,0:04:10.83,main,Steel,0,0,0,,I have something on my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.02,0:04:14.34,main,Steel,0,0,0,,The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.34,0:04:17.48,main,Steel,0,0,0,,I've fallen in love with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.48,0:04:19.59,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Like I give a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.59,0:04:21.24,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Don't come to me with crap like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.24,0:04:23.03,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You can tell me all about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.03,0:04:24.49,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Butt out, Reaper!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:28.02,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You're in love? That's fabulous, Steel!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.02,0:04:30.87,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Reaper-san, are you interested \Nin people's love lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.83,0:04:34.71,main,Beast,0,0,0,,D-Didn't think you were the type...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.71,0:04:37.74,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,So? What kind of person are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.74,0:04:40.82,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Terribly wild, yet very understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.48,0:04:41.44,sign_6725_61_Mmm,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(45,40,40,35)\fad(1,451)}Mmm
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.57,0:04:44.43,main,Beast,0,0,0,,No one wants to see a Reaper \Nmake that stupid, goofy expression!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.65,0:04:49.03,main,Steel,0,0,0,,But this person is technically a co-worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.03,0:04:50.93,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Hang on, you kiddin' me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.93,0:04:53.80,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Workplace romances are off-limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.80,0:04:54.94,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Give it up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.04,0:04:58.76,main,Steel,0,0,0,,I know that my feelings are wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.39,0:05:02.19,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Yet... I cannot stop myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.19,0:05:04.54,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Followin' the rules comes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:06.35,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Tell her, Reaper.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.78,0:05:07.81,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.82,0:05:11.23,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I completely understand how you feel, Steel!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.14,0:05:11.16,sign_24298_247_squee,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H4A2FBB&\3c&H1E1F2D&\bord2\move(565,90,605,50,1,241)\fad(241,1)}squee
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.16,0:05:12.20,sign_24298_247_squee,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H4A2FBB&\3c&H1E1F2D&\bord2\move(605,50,605,40,1,241)\t(1,241,\fs22)}squee
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.23,0:05:12.20,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.43,0:05:13.90,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Who cares if it's against the rules?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.90,0:05:15.96,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'll do everything I can to support you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.96,0:05:18.29,main,Beast,0,0,0,,What's got you so enthusiastic?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.29,0:05:19.92,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Thank you, Reaper-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.92,0:05:21.63,main,Beast,0,0,0,,I said you can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.63,0:05:24.98,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Okay, Steel. What do you want to do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.98,0:05:26.97,main,Beast,0,0,0,,It's like they don't even hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.05,0:05:32.44,main,Steel,0,0,0,,I'd like to tell this person how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.44,0:05:34.29,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yeah, that sounds right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.29,0:05:36.98,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You can't get anywhere until they know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.37,0:05:40.23,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.39,0:05:51.69,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm absent-minded, plain, and a poor worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.36,0:05:57.08,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I possess no qualities considered \Nappealing in a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.61,0:06:02.59,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,There's no way this person \Nwould ever return my feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.42,0:06:12.06,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Don't think that way, Steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.91,0:06:15.07,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I know you can make that confession!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.81,0:06:17.94,main,Steel,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.64,0:06:19.06,top,Desumi,0,0,0,,With femininity!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.43,0:06:20.89,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,We'll help your develop your femininity,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.89,0:06:23.69,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,and give you the courage to \Ntell this person how you feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.69,0:06:26.44,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Soldiers in an evil army \Ndon't need femininity!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.33,0:06:29.45,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Do you think I can do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.45,0:06:30.58,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Of course you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.58,0:06:33.20,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'll help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.20,0:06:34.84,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Reaper-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.68,0:06:38.97,main,Steel,0,0,0,,I will try!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:44.88,sign_4635_29_Cafeteria,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz9.77\fax-0.12\move(405,83,405,118)}Cafeteria
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.97,0:06:40.14,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.14,0:06:41.69,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Let's do our best, all three of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.69,0:06:43.88,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Since when am I a part of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.42,0:06:54.23,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.94,0:06:57.86,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.59,0:07:00.39,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.89,0:07:03.68,main,Reaper,0,0,0,,Pilates are great for your mental \Nand physical well-being.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.68,0:07:05.05,main,Reaper,0,0,0,,You have to concentrate, Beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.05,0:07:07.24,main,Beast,0,0,0,,I told you, I ain't part of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.24,0:07:08.40,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,How are you feeling, Steel?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.21,0:07:11.66,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Okay, next up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.66,0:07:21.17,sign_10494_114_Terror,Sign,0,0,0,,{\blur3}Terror
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.78,0:07:21.17,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Next up...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.17,0:07:23.92,sign_10578_116_The_Beautiful_Ma,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz-23.17\pos(80,120)\bord2\3c&HF5F8F5&}The {\c&H3D96F3&}Beautiful {\c&H1D211E&}Manners of {\c&HE587E8&}Maturity
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:29.67,sign_10644_117_Femininity,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(300,20)}Femininity
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.19,0:07:32.43,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Next up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.58,0:07:41.44,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Next up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.65,0:07:52.14,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,This exercise will develop your \Ncore muscles, giving you a great figure!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.45,0:07:55.17,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,H-Hey, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.17,0:07:56.71,main,Steel,0,0,0,,I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.66,0:08:01.96,main,Steel,0,0,0,,These exercises have only served \Nto confirm how worthless I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.61,0:08:07.96,main,Steel,0,0,0,,I will give up on love.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.61,0:08:12.15,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Thank you for trying your best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:14.86,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Hey, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.86,0:08:17.36,main,Beast,0,0,0,,I think you made her feel \Neven worse about herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.36,0:08:18.75,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Steel...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.89,0:08:24.02,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,I'll get you this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.26,0:08:25.81,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.17,0:08:39.24,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.71,0:08:42.91,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Sounds like you've been working really \Nhard to help your friend, Desumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.31,0:08:45.77,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Steel is just like I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.28,0:08:48.55,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,No confidence in herself at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.10,0:08:53.18,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,But I ended up getting ahead\Nof myself and hurting her instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.86,0:08:58.50,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I guess telling someone how you feel and \Ngetting them to date you isn't that easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.03,0:09:02.39,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Hey, Fudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.39,0:09:05.19,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What do you expect out of \Nyour significant other?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.19,0:09:06.72,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Nothing in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.72,0:09:07.86,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.86,0:09:11.19,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,As long as you're by my side, \Nthat's good enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.94,0:09:14.13,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,S-Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.13,0:09:15.56,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,There has to be something!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.56,0:09:17.69,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Don't you want me to be \Na good cook or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.69,0:09:18.46,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,There isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.19,0:09:21.70,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I like you just the way you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.09,0:09:29.47,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,H-Honestly... you're hopeless, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.77,0:09:33.21,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Thank you, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.66,0:09:35.72,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm a very lucky girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:38.43,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I just hope I helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.85,0:09:41.34,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yeah. You really did, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.11,0:09:48.03,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I forgot about something very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.23,0:09:51.73,sign_9769_111_Reaper_Princess_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(310,275)\b1\c&H1E1929&\3c&H6F54A3&}Steel Princess\N Dressing Room
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.36,0:09:51.73,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,We're coming in, Steel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.79,0:10:08.79,sign_5871_55_Missing,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(272,1)\3c&HDC37B3&\blur1}Iron Labyrinth
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.07,0:10:12.79,main,Beast,0,0,0,,She's been holed up like this a whole day now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.33,0:10:16.04,main,Beast,0,0,0,,When she gets like this, \Nshe refuses to budge,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.04,0:10:17.80,main,Beast,0,0,0,,and it gets dangerous to approach.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.01,0:10:21.97,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Stupid! Don't provoke her!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.97,0:10:25.22,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Her shell's system \Ncounterattacks automaticall!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.82,0:10:28.23,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Listen to me, Steel!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.23,0:10:30.17,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.17,0:10:32.61,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You never had to change!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.27,0:10:35.34,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,It's okay to have things you're not good at!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.34,0:10:37.02,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You should be just the way you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.02,0:10:39.36,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Be the Steel that we know!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.50,0:11:06.06,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,So, please, Steel...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.43,0:11:14.31,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Don't give up on love.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.17,0:11:18.15,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Just the way I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.25,0:11:22.95,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You didn't really give up, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.93,0:11:27.77,main,Steel,0,0,0,,I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.95,0:11:32.94,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You didn't really want to \Ndeny your feelings of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.12,0:11:36.60,main,Steel,0,0,0,,I didn't, Reaper-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.94,0:11:39.46,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Sheesh, what a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.70,0:11:41.87,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Thank you, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.34,0:11:44.47,main,Steel,0,0,0,,You've given me the courage I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.43,0:11:48.03,main,Steel,0,0,0,,I know that I'm incompetent,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.03,0:11:49.98,main,Steel,0,0,0,,and completely lacking in appeal...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.98,0:11:51.59,main,Steel,0,0,0,,But that's just
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.06,0:11:56.68,main,Steel,0,0,0,,the way I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.89,0:12:00.22,main,Steel,0,0,0,,I'm going to tell that person how I feel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.13,0:12:06.49,sign_17362_183_Eensy_weensy,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(435,30)\fad(1553,1)}Eensy-weensy
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.74,0:12:06.49,main,vo,0,0,0,,Eensy-weensy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.49,0:12:09.24,main,Beast,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat the shit outta you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.24,0:12:11.50,main,Beast,0,0,0,,I hope that person blows you off!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.86,0:12:15.25,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Hang on... {\i1}he's{\i0} the one she's confessing to?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.62,0:12:18.50,main,Beast,0,0,0,,And they're allowed to date?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.50,0:12:20.40,main,Beast,0,0,0,,This is totally against the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.40,0:12:22.06,main,Beast,0,0,0,,Every one of you, I swear...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.26,0:12:26.99,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm so happy for you, Steel!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.15,0:12:33.40,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Love After World Domination!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.38,0:12:43.88,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,I'm grateful for this food.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.31,0:12:57.75,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,It's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.75,0:12:58.91,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Eat up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.30,0:13:00.23,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.23,0:13:04.51,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,That super-duper nice! Thanks tons, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.51,0:13:07.51,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,In exchange, I have a favor to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.15,0:13:09.47,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.47,0:13:10.70,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,I figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.70,0:13:12.47,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,Sure thing, gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.26,0:13:16.42,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Allow me to borrow Steel Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.42,0:13:18.10,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,Steel Princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:27.46,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,Sure thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.46,0:13:28.64,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Y-You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.64,0:13:29.70,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,Totally, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.70,0:13:32.49,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,But she's pretty frickin' stupid. You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.49,0:13:34.57,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Don't you say that about her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.57,0:13:35.42,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,Hang on, hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:38.00,main,Catapult,0,0,0,,You're scary when you blow up like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.27,0:13:47.47,main,Culverin,0,0,0,,Take this, Gelato 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.93,0:13:50.04,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Waves of Love Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.73,0:14:00.23,main,Yellow,0,0,0,,Hang on! What's Steel Princess doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.23,0:14:02.67,main,Blue,0,0,0,,I thought she was on a different squad!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.67,0:14:04.23,main,Green,0,0,0,,What's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.08,0:14:04.23,top,Culverin,0,0,0,,The power of love!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.23,0:14:07.24,main,Blue,0,0,0,,We don't have a choice. \NI've got to call Red back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:12.99,main,Pink,0,0,0,,Red-san isn't here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.99,0:14:15.68,main,Blue,0,0,0,,B-But... I was sure he came this way...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.68,0:14:16.69,main,Pink,0,0,0,,He didn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.07,0:14:19.71,main,Pink,0,0,0,,But if you insist on coming this way...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.95,0:14:22.38,main,Pink,0,0,0,,You'll have to beat me first!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.38,0:14:23.21,main,Blue,0,0,0,,Quoi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.01,0:14:27.19,main,Blue,0,0,0,,This is like a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.13,0:14:37.06,italics,Haru,0,0,0,,Praise me! Praise me! Praise me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.24,0:14:35.87,sign_20961_224_Praise_me,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(570,110,595,88)\fad(634,934)}Praise me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.95,0:14:36.58,sign_20961_224_Praise_me,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(475,40,485,20)\fad(634,934)}Praise me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.49,0:14:37.06,sign_20961_224_Praise_me,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(285,20)\fad(634,934)}Praise me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.06,0:14:38.69,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,T-Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.69,0:14:40.44,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,We appreciate it, Haru.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.60,0:14:48.02,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Oh, I know, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.48,0:14:51.25,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.38,0:14:57.75,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You made us lunch, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.98,0:14:59.01,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.01,0:15:02.21,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Thank you for bringing me into this \Nworld in the same era as Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.21,0:15:04.25,sign_21632_234_Shove,Sign,0,0,0,,Shove
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.21,0:15:04.25,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,It's really not that big a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.63,0:15:05.71,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Let's eat—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.71,0:15:07.18,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Wait, Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:08.21,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.83,0:15:11.02,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,According to the specialist \Ntexts I consulted,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.02,0:15:13.60,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,when couples eat together,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.01,0:15:17.85,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,they're supposed to... feed each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.85,0:15:20.77,sign_22007_242_Feed___,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(65,35)\fscy155\fad(442,1)}F\NE\NE\ND\N{\fscx75}!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.42,0:15:20.77,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Feed each other!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.77,0:15:23.11,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Oh, I've heard of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.11,0:15:25.23,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,At last, I'll get to see it done!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.23,0:15:28.69,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,God above, thank you for creating this world!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.69,0:15:30.61,sign_21632_234_Shove,Sign,0,0,0,,Shove
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.69,0:15:30.61,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,C'mon, cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.31,0:15:34.78,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I feel like we're at about \Nthe stage to try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.78,0:15:37.87,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Agreed. Let's advance to that next step.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.58,0:15:48.34,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,H-Here it comes, Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.85,0:15:50.84,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Bring it on, Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.31,0:15:55.03,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,O-Open wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.43,0:16:01.74,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,O-Opening wide...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.12,0:16:15.32,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,What is... happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.64,0:16:17.28,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What is it, Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.95,0:16:22.29,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,My stomach hurts... like it's\N never hurt before!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.29,0:16:23.54,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.54,0:16:26.56,sign_23630_259_Heave,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(545,105)\fad(1,492)}Heave
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.56,0:16:27.56,sign_23630_259_Heave,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,492)\pos(555,165)}Heave
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:28.13,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.56,0:16:28.56,sign_23630_259_Heave,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,492)\pos(545,105)}Heave
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.13,0:16:29.55,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,This is no time for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.56,0:16:29.55,sign_23630_259_Heave,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,492)\pos(555,165)}Heave
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:33.47,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,These could be my last breaths...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.09,0:16:34.93,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.93,0:16:37.93,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I don't want to feed you this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.82,0:16:42.15,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,And so... I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.50,0:16:46.59,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,F-Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.59,0:16:49.31,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Haru! Emergency!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.94,0:16:57.70,sign_9447_74_1_Week_Earlier,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9\pos(535,65)\fs32\fad(1031,1)}3\NDays\N Later
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.94,0:16:57.70,sign_24287_272_Machino_Hospital,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz10.35\fax-0.2\move(120,60,120,102)\fad(1031,1)}Machino Hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.70,0:17:03.71,sign_24401_274_Dear_Red_Gelato_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(215,280,240,105)}Dear Red Gelato,\N\N We wish you a swift recovery.\N If you are to die,\Nwe hope it will be at our hands.\N\N Gekko's Great Leader\N Supreme Leader Bosslar
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.99,0:17:01.95,main,Prof,0,0,0,,His doctor said he can go home tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:01.95,0:17:03.71,main,Haru,0,0,0,,That's such a relief, Senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.09,0:17:09.07,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,But I guess appendicitis can take \Nout even the toughest among us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.07,0:17:10.71,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry for all the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.71,0:17:12.51,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Now, none of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.51,0:17:13.72,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Just rest for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.96,0:17:15.16,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,I peeled you an apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.16,0:17:16.25,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.25,0:17:18.47,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Thanks, Misaki-neesan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.47,0:17:20.14,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Open wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.36,0:17:22.60,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Opening wide...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.93,0:17:28.15,flashback,Desumi,0,0,0,,O-Open wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.70,0:17:32.15,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,No! Desumi-san must be \Nthe first woman to feed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.36,0:17:35.55,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,The heck are you doing, Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.55,0:17:37.32,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Open your mouth already!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.32,0:17:40.34,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,Stop playing around and eat it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.56,0:17:46.75,sign_25500_290_Chomp,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(355,20)}Chomp
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.22,0:17:46.20,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,You're both acting crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.17,0:17:49.25,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Haru-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.31,0:17:52.76,main,Prof,0,0,0,,Goodbye for now. Take care, Fudo-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:54.60,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.60,0:17:55.76,main,Misaki,0,0,0,,See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.76,0:17:59.64,sign_25793_296_Inpatient_Buildi,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(330,215,355,215)\frz1.2\frx2\fry42}Inpatient Building\NExamination Room
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.40,0:18:08.48,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Now, Fudo, open wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.97,0:18:11.21,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:15.28,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Opening wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.28,0:18:16.35,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,I brought apples!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.35,0:18:17.53,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.79,0:18:19.61,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,Eh? What was close?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.97,0:18:21.78,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Oh... nothing, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.78,0:18:23.33,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,I brought you a change of clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.33,0:18:24.79,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.79,0:18:27.79,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,I'll leave the apples here, \Nso you can eat them later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.79,0:18:30.22,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,Well, I have volleyball \Nwith my women's group!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.22,0:18:31.10,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.59,0:18:37.00,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,This must be some kind of karmic retribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.43,0:18:41.47,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.47,0:18:43.70,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Don't do anything stupid, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.75,0:18:47.85,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You'll pop your stitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.85,0:18:49.05,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.45,0:18:51.79,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I heard they're letting you out tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.79,0:18:55.02,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,but I wanted to see you while you\N were in this unusual situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.17,0:18:56.96,sign_24298_247_squee,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(170,450)\fs24\move(475,120,475,105,1,1006)\c&H3A12E3&\3c&HE3EEFF&\bord2\an8}squee
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.00,0:18:57.33,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Oh so cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.13,0:18:57.86,sign_3317_26_The_cuteness,sign,0,0,0,,{\fs15\pos(90,195)}Oh so cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.28,0:19:00.34,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You seem to be feeling a lot better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.34,0:19:01.82,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,The color's back in your face, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.06,0:19:06.33,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I'd never die until I let you feed me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.47,0:19:08.10,sign_27488_323_Shove,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,496)}Shove
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:08.10,sign_27488_323_Shove,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,496)\an9}Shove
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.48,0:19:09.75,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Don't talk big, Mr. Appendicitis!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.75,0:19:11.33,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,You're hitting my stitches!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.51,0:19:15.45,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Honestly, you're just so silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.49,0:19:33.26,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Here, Fudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.26,0:19:34.56,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,To celebrate your recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:44.07,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Open wide!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.52,0:19:46.30,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Opening wide...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.55,0:20:03.40,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,H-H-How did you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.40,0:20:06.59,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,No food since the dawn of civilization \Nhas ever been so delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.79,0:20:14.99,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.55,0:20:16.51,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.82,0:20:20.51,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,I just remembered, Fudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.51,0:20:23.07,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,Your father's coming to pick you \Nup in his mini truck tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.07,0:20:23.88,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,The mood!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.88,0:20:25.07,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,Oh, is this a friend of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.07,0:20:26.53,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,Can you play volleyball?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.53,0:20:28.03,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,We need more players to fill the team!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.03,0:20:29.07,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,Come, come, come, come!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.07,0:20:30.68,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,The mood!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.23,0:22:14.60,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.98,0:22:19.98,sign_32080_344_The_Active_Senio,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz-13.67\fax0.27\fsp2\pos(460,120)}Sudden Death Seniors
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.71,0:22:30.07,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,You were such a big help today, Desumi-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.07,0:22:31.97,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,It was my pleasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.97,0:22:33.65,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Call me any time you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.65,0:22:35.24,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,You know I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.24,0:22:37.21,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,But I'm sorry for what I did earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.43,0:22:40.21,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,I know you were in the middle of feeding him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.31,0:22:45.15,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,A-Actually, I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.15,0:22:46.62,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,No need to be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.48,0:22:48.67,sign_32739_352_Pat,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz26.57\pos(240,50)\fad(200,1)}Pat
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.84,0:22:48.67,sign_32739_352_Pat,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz26.57\pos(235,75)\fad(200,1)}Pat
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.62,0:22:48.67,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,I did the same thing with \Nmy man back in the day!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.34,0:22:52.68,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,Despite what you might think, I used \Nto be a real looker back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.68,0:22:53.79,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,Want to see?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.54,0:23:03.02,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,S-So cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.65,0:23:06.29,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,Yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.29,0:23:07.78,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,I really was, wasn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.53,0:23:15.40,main,Fudo's mother,0,0,0,,Desumi-chan, take care of my Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.51,0:23:17.46,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.65,0:23:24.93,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Secret Society Gekko has a combatant \Ncafeteria and dormitory facilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.93,0:23:28.21,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,A mentorship system helps \Nto guide the inexperienced.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.21,0:23:30.81,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,We treasure individuality in our work force
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.81,0:23:33.85,top,Bosslar,0,0,0,,as we work together to \Nachieve world domination!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.49,0:23:40.25,sign_8302_60_Episode_1__I_Lov,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\fad(1005,1)\pos(194,302)}Episode 6    {\fsp2.5}As Long as We're at the Beach...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.85,0:23:36.49,top,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Next time: "As Long as We're at the Beach..."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.24,0:23:40.25,sign_33956_369_Secret_Society_G,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,145)\fsp5\fad(758,1)}Secret Society {\c&H0100E7&}Gekko
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.49,0:23:39.53,top,Bosslar,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting for your resumes!
